{"sections":[{"slug":"形式伴随","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"形式伴随"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式伴随</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"形式伴随"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设有函子</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C \\to\\mathcal D$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">形式左伴随</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是函子</span> $\\mathcal D \\to \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Ani})^{\\mathrm{op}}$,$$\r\nd\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(d,F(-)).\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">形式右伴随</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是函子</span> $\\mathcal D \\to \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Ani})$,$$\r\nd\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(-),d).\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\pi\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathsf{Ani}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象的形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/常值层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">常值层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $\\pi^*\\colon \\mathsf{Ani} \\to \\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的形式左伴随</span> $\\pi_!\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathsf{Ani},\\mathsf{Ani})$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $1\\in\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的取值</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}